{"t":"say","text":"For 15 developers, Qoder Teams gives you managed seats, SSO and admin controls for AI-assisted coding."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-teams","fit":"primary","why":"Managed coding agent seats with SSO, privacy mode and usage analytics for your dev team."}
{"t":"rec","product":"token-plan","fit":"complement","why":"Team subscription providing per-member model keys for the coding tools your developers use."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Qoder Teams is the right fit for 15 developers; add Token Plan if they also use external IDEs."}

{"t":"say","text":"For a team AI agent, Qoder Teams is the ready-made assistant for developers; if your team includes non-developers, QwenWork fits better."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-teams","fit":"primary","why":"Qoder seats for engineering teams with SSO, admin controls and usage analytics."}
{"t":"rec","product":"token-plan","fit":"complement","why":"Per-member model keys so each developer can call Qwen inside their coding tools."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qwenwork","fit":"complement","why":"All-in-one workplace agent for docs, slides and web pages across the whole team."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Recommended Qoder Teams as the primary team AI agent, with Token Plan for model access and QwenWork for non-dev teammates."}

{"t":"say","text":"For 20 engineers using Qwen models in Claude Code and Cursor, Token Plan gives per-member keys at a predictable monthly cost."}
{"t":"rec","product":"token-plan","fit":"primary","why":"Per-seat subscription for interactive coding tools like Cursor and Claude Code with predictable monthly billing."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Token Plan provides 20 per-member keys for your team to use Qwen models inside Cursor and Claude Code."}

{"t":"say","text":"Mumbai (ap-south-1) is closed. I'll place the servers in Singapore and use ESA for low latency to India."}
{"t":"req","text":"Low latency for users in India"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","ecs","rds"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"India users","group":"internet","why":"End users in India needing low latency."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves domain to ESA edge nodes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates traffic from India to Singapore origin."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"App VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes traffic to app servers across zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the application in two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Database","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores application data with zone standby."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Singapore architecture with ESA edge acceleration for low latency to India users, ALB, ECS and RDS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a protected e-commerce site using ESA for DDoS and edge WAF, plus Captcha and Fraud Detection against bots."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","waf","alb","ecs","tair","rds","captcha","fraud-detection","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Shoppers & Bots","group":"internet","why":"Visitors including malicious bots targeting sign-up and login."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the shop domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge Protection","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA with DDoS defense","group":"edge","why":"Absorbs DDoS attacks and accelerates traffic at the edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF 3.0","group":"edge","attachTo":"esa","why":"Blocks credential stuffing and OWASP attacks on ESA."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Shop VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes clean traffic to app servers across two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the e-commerce application logic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores sessions so credential stuffing hits are fast-rejected."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Persists orders and user accounts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"say","text":"Captcha challenges suspicious sign-ups; Fraud Detection scores login attempts for account takeover risk."}
{"t":"node","id":"captcha","product":"captcha","label":"Captcha","group":"sg","why":"Challenges bot sign-ups with CAPTCHA 2.0 before account creation."}
{"t":"node","id":"fraud","product":"fraud-detection","label":"Fraud Detection","group":"sg","why":"Scores login and registration requests for credential stuffing risk."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-captcha","from":"app","to":"captcha","label":"verify"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-fraud","from":"app","to":"fraud","label":"score"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Security Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects WAF, ESA and app logs for attack forensics."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"rec","product":"anti-ddos-proxy","fit":"complement","why":"Add Anti-DDoS Proxy behind ESA if attacks exceed ESA scrubbing capacity."}
{"t":"done","summary":"E-commerce protected by ESA with WAF, ALB, ECS, Captcha for sign-ups, Fraud Detection for logins, and SLS logging."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll swap the ECS app servers for ACK, keeping Auto Scaling off since ACK scales its own node pools."}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ack","label":"Store cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the store on managed Kubernetes across two zones."}
{"t":"remove","id":"scaling"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Replaced ECS and Auto Scaling with a two-zone ACK cluster; all edges to app are preserved."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw an enterprise AI agent architecture using AgentCore for governance and MCP, with human approval via EventBridge and Function Compute."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","cloud-native-api-gateway","agentcore","ai-gateway","model-studio","eventbridge","fc","sls","ram","agent-security-center","acgc"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Enterprise users","group":"internet","why":"Staff interacting with governed AI agents."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the agent platform domain."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Agent VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Ingress load balancer for agent traffic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Authenticates requests and routes to AgentCore."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway"}
{"t":"node","id":"agentcore","product":"agentcore","label":"AgentCore","group":"vpc","why":"Runs and governs agents with skills and MCP tools."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-agentcore","from":"gateway","to":"agentcore"}
{"t":"node","id":"ai-gw","product":"ai-gateway","label":"AI Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Routes LLM calls with fallback, limits and guardrails."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-aigw","from":"agentcore","to":"ai-gw"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"sg","why":"Hosts Qwen models for agent reasoning."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-aigw-llm","from":"ai-gw","to":"llm"}
{"t":"node","id":"events","product":"eventbridge","label":"EventBridge","group":"sg","why":"Routes approval events to human reviewers."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-events","from":"agentcore","to":"events","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"approval","product":"fc","label":"Approval handler","group":"sg","why":"Processes human approval callbacks and resumes agents."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-events-approval","from":"events","to":"approval","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Log Service","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes agent traces and audit logs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-logs","from":"agentcore","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"ram","product":"ram","label":"RAM","group":null,"why":"Controls identities and policies for agent access."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-ram","from":"agentcore","to":"ram","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"asc","product":"agent-security-center","label":"Agent Security Center","group":null,"why":"Scans skills, enforces guardrails and red-teams agents."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-asc","from":"agentcore","to":"asc","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"acgc","product":"acgc","label":"Agentic Cloud Governance Center","group":null,"why":"Governs multi-account landing zones for agent workloads."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-acgc-ram","from":"acgc","to":"ram","kind":"control"}
{"t":"rec","product":"agentcore","fit":"primary","why":"Build, run and govern enterprise agents with MCP tools and skills."}
{"t":"rec","product":"agent-security-center","fit":"complement","why":"Adds AI-BOM, runtime protection and skill scanning for agents."}
{"t":"rec","product":"ai-gateway","fit":"complement","why":"Provides multi-model routing, token limits and guardrails for LLM calls."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Enterprise AI agent platform on AgentCore with API Gateway, AI Gateway, Model Studio, EventBridge for human approval, and full governance."}

{"t":"req","text":"Budget under $200 per month"}
{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a lean MVP: single-zone ECS, ALB, RDS and OSS to stay well under your budget."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ecs","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Users","group":"internet","why":"People using the web app."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves domain to ALB IP."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"MVP VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","why":"Routes HTTPS traffic to the app server."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App server","group":"vpc","why":"Runs the web app and auth logic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"User DB","group":"vpc","why":"Stores accounts and app data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Static assets","group":"sg","why":"Holds uploads and static files cheaply."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-media","from":"app","to":"media","label":"objects"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects app logs for debugging."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Lean single-zone MVP with ECS, ALB, RDS and OSS, designed to stay under $200/month."}

{"t":"say","text":"Adding Elasticsearch for full-text search. This adds cost, so use a small 1-node cluster to stay under budget."}
{"t":"node","id":"search","product":"elasticsearch","label":"Listings search","group":"vpc","why":"Full-text search over product listings."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-search","from":"app","to":"search","label":"query"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added a single-node Elasticsearch inside the VPC for full-text listing search; keep it small to respect the $200 budget."}

{"t":"say","text":"Adding zones a,b to ALB, ECS, RDS and Elasticsearch for HA. This roughly doubles compute and DB costs."}
{"t":"req","text":"Budget under $200 per month"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Spreads traffic across two zones for HA."}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App server","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs app in two zones so one failure is tolerated."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"User DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Primary-standby across zones for failover."}
{"t":"node","id":"search","product":"elasticsearch","label":"Listings search","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Two-zone cluster keeps search available on failure."}
{"t":"done","summary":"All core nodes now span zones a and b for high availability; cost will increase but should stay under budget with small instance sizes."}

{"t":"say","text":"15명 개발팀용 코딩 AI 에이전트를 추천해 드릴게요. Qoder Teams가 적합합니다."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-teams","fit":"primary","why":"SSO와 관리자 기능을 갖춘 15명 개발팀용 코딩 에이전트"}
{"t":"rec","product":"token-plan","fit":"complement","why":"Qoder Teams에서 사용할 모델 토큰 구독"}
{"t":"done","summary":"15명 개발팀에는 Qoder Teams를 기본으로, Token Plan을 함께 구성하는 것을 권장합니다."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a serverless microservices backend using SAE (no Kubernetes), API Gateway, RocketMQ for order events, and managed databases."}
{"t":"req","text":"No Kubernetes; team lacks K8s experience"}
{"t":"plan","products":["mobile-app","dns","esa","cloud-native-api-gateway","waf","sae","rocketmq","tair","rds","oss","sls","arms"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"mobile-app","label":"Delivery App","group":"internet","why":"Customers and riders using the mobile app."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the API domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-dns","from":"app","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates and secures mobile API traffic globally."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-esa","from":"app","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Delivery VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes REST APIs to 12 microservices with auth and throttling."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"gateway","why":"Blocks injection attacks and bots at the gateway."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-gateway","from":"esa","to":"gateway","label":"origin"}
{"t":"say","text":"Twelve microservices run on SAE, which scales containers without any Kubernetes management."}
{"t":"node","id":"svc-order","product":"sae","label":"Order Service","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Handles order creation, updates and status queries."}
{"t":"node","id":"svc-rest","product":"sae","label":"Other Microservices","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Remaining 11 services: restaurant, rider, payment, etc."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-order","from":"gateway","to":"svc-order","label":"REST"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-rest","from":"gateway","to":"svc-rest","label":"REST"}
{"t":"say","text":"Order events flow through RocketMQ so services react asynchronously without tight coupling."}
{"t":"node","id":"mq","product":"rocketmq","label":"RocketMQ","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Decouples order events across all microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-order-mq","from":"svc-order","to":"mq","label":"events","kind":"async"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-mq-rest","from":"mq","to":"svc-rest","label":"consume","kind":"async"}
{"t":"say","text":"Tair caches menus and sessions; RDS stores orders and relational data durably."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session & Menu Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Fast lookups for menus, carts and user sessions."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Durable storage for orders, users and payments."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-order-cache","from":"svc-order","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-order-db","from":"svc-order","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rest-cache","from":"svc-rest","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rest-db","from":"svc-rest","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Menu Images","group":"sg","why":"Stores food photos served via ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"images"}
{"t":"say","text":"ARMS traces requests across services and SLS collects logs for debugging."}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Log Service","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs from all 12 microservices."}
{"t":"node","id":"apm","product":"arms","label":"ARMS APM","group":"sg","why":"Distributed tracing and alerting across services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-order-logs","from":"svc-order","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rest-logs","from":"svc-rest","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-order-apm","from":"svc-order","to":"apm","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rest-apm","from":"svc-rest","to":"apm","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Food-delivery backend with 12 SAE microservices behind API Gateway, RocketMQ for order events, Tair cache and RDS database."}

{"t":"say","text":"The existing Tair node already caches menus and sessions, so I'll rename it to make that clearer."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Menu & Session Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches restaurant menus and user sessions for fast reads."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Renamed the existing Tair cache label to Menu & Session Cache; no new nodes needed."}

{"t":"say","text":"SAE and RocketMQ scale automatically, so I'll add a PolarDB read replica for the 5x query load."}
{"t":"node","id":"db-read","product":"polardb","label":"PolarDB Read Replica","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Handles 5x read traffic for menus and order history without touching the primary."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rest-db-read","from":"svc-rest","to":"db-read","label":"SQL reads"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added PolarDB read replica; SAE and RocketMQ already autoscale to handle 5x traffic without Kubernetes."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add a new SAE AI service calling Model Studio for dish search, with Milvus storing menu embeddings."}
{"t":"node","id":"svc-ai","product":"sae","label":"AI Dish Assistant","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Handles natural-language dish queries via LLM, no Kubernetes needed."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-ai","from":"gateway","to":"svc-ai","label":"REST"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Qwen LLM","group":"sg","why":"Understands customer queries and suggests dishes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ai-llm","from":"svc-ai","to":"llm","label":"prompt"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector","product":"milvus","label":"Menu Embeddings","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Vector search over dish descriptions for RAG retrieval."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ai-vector","from":"svc-ai","to":"vector","label":"search"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added AI assistant: new SAE service calls Model Studio Qwen and Milvus vector search for dish recommendations."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a secure customer portal in Singapore with ESA, ALB, WAF, ECS, Tair cache and RDS."}
{"t":"req","text":"Customer data must stay in Singapore"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls","kms","cloud-firewall","nat"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Fintech customers","group":"internet","why":"Customers accessing the portal from browsers."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves portal domain to ESA edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates and secures traffic at the edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Portal VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"cf","product":"cloud-firewall","label":"Cloud Firewall","group":"vpc","why":"Inspects inbound internet traffic before ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-cf","from":"esa","to":"cf","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes HTTPS traffic across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF 3.0","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks on the portal."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-cf-alb","from":"cf","to":"alb"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Portal servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the web app in two zones for HA."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales instances during peak login times."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Sessions go to Tair, customer records to RDS, both multi-zone. KMS encrypts data at rest."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores sessions and tokens in memory."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Customer DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Primary database for customer data in SG."}
{"t":"node","id":"kms","product":"kms","label":"KMS","group":"sg","why":"Encrypts database and storage keys."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Customer docs","group":"sg","why":"Stores uploaded KYC documents securely."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-docs","from":"app","to":"docs","label":"objects"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Outbound access for patches without public IPs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-nat","from":"app","to":"nat","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Audit logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralised audit and access logs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Singapore-only fintech portal: ESA, Cloud Firewall, ALB+WAF, dual-zone ECS, Tair, RDS, OSS, KMS and SLS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add disaster recovery within Singapore: RDS cross-zone standby, OSS cross-zone replication, and Cloud Backup."}
{"t":"req","text":"Customer data must stay in Singapore"}
{"t":"node","id":"backup","product":"cloud-backup","label":"Cloud Backup","group":"sg","why":"Scheduled backups for ECS, RDS and OSS within Singapore."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-backup","from":"app","to":"backup","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-backup","from":"db","to":"backup","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-docs-backup","from":"docs","to":"backup","kind":"control"}
